  "status_text": "One size up, the same thing shows: on at least eleven 5 by 5 graphs, NOT gates are now checked to save at least one gate. Each has a circuit of at most 10 AND, OR and NOT gates of fan-in two on one-a-side inputs [L-meta-19305 and L-meta-19248 among them], under a checked count of at least 11 AND/OR gates without NOT gates [L-meta-9421 for the second of these]. The open bet is that the saving never passes 2n - 5, which is 5 at this size [L-meta-19158, a conjecture].",
